            Numbers 1, 6, 7, 8, 9, and 10 in the rankings form a cluster: <code>ansi-styles</code>, <code>strip-ansi</code>, <code>supports-color</code>, <code>string-width</code>, <code>wrap-ansi</code>, and <code>ansi-regex</code>. All part of the ANSI terminal color ecosystem. All with a single maintainer. Combined: over 2.1 billion weekly downloads.
          </p>

